====== Davolink DV-201AMR ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The Davolink DV-201AMR is a an ADSL modem with 4 Fast Ethernet ports, Wireless Access Point and VoIP (2 times FXS).
The modem was distributed by Versatel/Tele2 in the Netherlands until beginning 2007.

===== Supported Versions =====

**NOTE:** Internal ADSL not supported.

^ OpenWrt Version Supported   ^ Notes                            ^
| Backfire 10.03.1            | CRC error after the first boot   |
| Attitude Adjustment 12.09   | may run out of memory            |

**NOTE:** Old versions need to have the mtd changes to fix crc error for the brcm63xx platform created by [[https://forum.openwrt.org/profile.php?id=18299|Cshore]] (tested with 25565).

